---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy – Amsterdam Pauper League">
  <main class="flex-1">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-screen-md px-4 py-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter mb-2">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-10 text-sm">
        Last updated: January 2026
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            The Amsterdam Pauper League (&ldquo;APL&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;,
            &ldquo;us&rdquo;, or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) is a competitive Magic:
            The Gathering™ Pauper tournament series based in Amsterdam, the
            Netherlands. You can contact us via our{" "}
            <a
              href="https://discord.gg/qr6vjzY58W"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground transition-colors"
            >
              Discord server
            </a>{" "}
            or{" "}
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/dutchpauperleague"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground transition-colors"
            >
              Instagram
            </a>
            .
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">What data we collect</h2>
          <p>We collect the minimum data necessary to operate the league:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-foreground">Player name</strong> — used
              for tournament registration, standings, and event results
              published on this website.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-foreground">Email address</strong> —
              collected by our registration platform (TopDeck.gg) when you
              sign up for an event. We use it only to send event-related
              communications.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-foreground">Payment information</strong> —
              processed securely by Stripe. We do not store your card details.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">How we use your data</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>To register you for APL events.</li>
            <li>
              To publish tournament results and league standings on this
              website (player names and match results are public).
            </li>
            <li>
              To communicate event updates, schedule changes, or other
              league-related information.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">We do not sell your data</h2>
          <p>
            We will never sell, rent, or share your personal data with third
            parties for marketing purposes. Data is shared only with service
            providers strictly necessary to run the league (TopDeck.gg for
            registration and Stripe for payments).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Data retention</h2>
          <p>
            Tournament results and standings are retained indefinitely as
            part of the league&apos;s historical record. Contact us if you
            wish to request removal of your personal data from our systems.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Your rights (GDPR)</h2>
          <p>
            If you are located in the European Economic Area, you have the
            right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. You may
            also object to or restrict certain processing. To exercise any of
            these rights, please contact us via Discord or Instagram.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            This website uses only essential cookies required for the
            site&apos;s functionality (such as theme preference). We do not
            use tracking or advertising cookies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this privacy policy from time to time. The date at
            the top of this page indicates when it was last revised.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
